WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

00:06.580 --> 00:07.980
[Respect Copyright; Everyone's Responsibility]

00:08.360 --> 00:09.800
♪Data is screaming♪

00:09.800 --> 00:11.330
♪Proposals are burning♪

00:11.330 --> 00:13.200
♪I deconstruct the world's algorithms♪

00:13.200 --> 00:14.900
♪Only never counting the heartbeat♪

00:14.900 --> 00:17.160
♪Whose perfect smile is reflected in the glass?♪

00:17.160 --> 00:18.760
♪Treading on shadows as I run ahead♪

00:18.760 --> 00:20.300
♪There's no time to fall♪

00:20.330 --> 00:23.000
♪They say gears should be obedient♪

00:23.100 --> 00:25.660
♪Yet I insist on being the offbeat stopwatch♪

00:25.800 --> 00:29.040
♪Planting my own pride in the cracks of the rules♪

00:29.200 --> 00:31.800
♪Waiting for the night to grow its dawn♪

00:33.200 --> 00:35.930
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

00:35.930 --> 00:37.280
♪No claimed ground, no comparison♪

00:37.280 --> 00:38.660
♪I won't be anyone's footnote♪

00:38.660 --> 00:40.040
♪Though there are thousand of templates♪

00:40.040 --> 00:41.730
♪I choose only the sharpest second♪

00:41.730 --> 00:44.100
♪Answering life as my own thinking question♪

00:44.100 --> 00:46.860
♪I am my own never-landing beacon♪

00:46.860 --> 00:48.320
♪No borrowed light, no offered prayer♪

00:48.320 --> 00:49.530
♪I won't believe in anyone's castle♪

00:49.530 --> 00:50.960
♪Even if the world is an exam hall♪

00:50.960 --> 00:52.800
♪I'll hand in early and run away♪

00:52.800 --> 00:54.100
♪Writing in one single line for the answer♪

00:54.460 --> 00:55.820
♪"I dare to claim it!"♪

01:05.440 --> 01:07.860
♪I am my own irreplaceable coordinate♪

01:07.860 --> 01:09.400
♪No substitute, no imitation♪

01:09.400 --> 01:10.560
♪I won't trade for anyone's glory♪

01:10.560 --> 01:12.040
♪Though there are thousands of echoes♪

01:12.040 --> 01:13.700
♪I listen only to the loneliest second♪

01:13.700 --> 01:16.000
♪Walking life into my own exclamation mark♪

01:16.000 --> 01:18.760
♪I am my own never-extinguishing lamp♪

01:18.760 --> 01:20.360
♪No wind‑borne drift, no shore‑bound rest♪

01:20.360 --> 01:21.700
♪I won't linger in anyone's course♪

01:21.700 --> 01:23.160
♪Even if there are millions of scripts♪

01:23.160 --> 01:24.960
♪I'll tear them up and rewrite today♪

01:24.960 --> 01:26.060
♪Signing the signature at the end with only♪

01:26.380 --> 01:27.740
♪"I create it!"♪

01:33.400 --> 01:37.980
[Irreplaceable]

01:37.980 --> 01:40.980
[Episode 19]

01:47.980 --> 01:49.860
[Organizational Efficiency Push. Process Efficiency Diagram]

01:55.790 --> 01:56.210
Mr. Bu,

01:56.790 --> 01:58.020
Tianna's strategic analysis skills

01:58.070 --> 01:58.980
are outstanding.

02:00.070 --> 02:01.570
If she hadn't left Maxmise,

02:02.790 --> 02:04.460
she'd have been the first among us

02:04.510 --> 02:05.770
to make partner.

02:08.190 --> 02:09.540
With any other entrepreneur,

02:09.590 --> 02:11.100
having a successor this good

02:12.030 --> 02:13.340
would make them ecstatic.

02:15.680 --> 02:16.610
So why haven't you ever

02:18.870 --> 02:19.660
put her

02:19.710 --> 02:20.850
in a key position?

02:22.910 --> 02:23.410
Go on.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.130
Tianna blames it all

02:27.150 --> 02:28.410
on you favoring boys over girls.

02:29.400 --> 02:30.450
I actually think

02:32.000 --> 02:32.820
you're afraid.

02:35.030 --> 02:36.730
Buffett worked until 90

02:36.960 --> 02:37.660
and never handed over power.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.010
You're not even 60.

02:41.630 --> 02:42.690
I think there's only one reason.

02:43.430 --> 02:45.780
You don't want to name a successor too early.

02:50.590 --> 02:51.450
The more outstanding

02:52.080 --> 02:52.660
Tianna becomes,

02:53.520 --> 02:55.100
and the more determined she is to do well at Siwei,

02:55.310 --> 02:56.060
the more worried you get.

02:56.800 --> 02:58.660
Because she's basically

02:59.710 --> 03:00.610
telling you

03:01.400 --> 03:02.130
you're getting older.

03:03.030 --> 03:04.170
And in a few years,

03:06.030 --> 03:08.010
the next generation might replace you.

03:08.680 --> 03:09.410
That's why

03:10.280 --> 03:12.130
you've always spoiled Tianjie on purpose.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.570
You quietly hint to the higher-ups

03:14.630 --> 03:16.730
that Tianjie is your successor.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.380
Because you know perfectly well

03:20.800 --> 03:22.410
that for the next 20 years, until Tianjie is

03:22.470 --> 03:23.690
the same age Tianna is now,

03:24.840 --> 03:26.100
you need to keep

03:27.590 --> 03:29.850
Siwei's power firmly in your own hands.

03:36.080 --> 03:36.500
Mr. Bu,

03:37.680 --> 03:38.780
if you want the business to last,

03:39.960 --> 03:42.010
you have to focus on building a management pipeline.

03:43.000 --> 03:43.690
Tianna has

03:43.750 --> 03:44.730
zero sense of security.

03:45.960 --> 03:48.820
All her arrogance and anger

03:50.470 --> 03:51.570
really come down to one thing.

03:54.310 --> 03:55.060
She's scared

03:56.750 --> 03:58.290
that one day you'll stop loving her.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.130
Or

04:01.840 --> 04:03.380
she's scared of being replaced

04:03.870 --> 04:04.540
by her brother.

04:08.630 --> 04:09.380
You love Tianna

04:10.280 --> 04:11.890
more than I ever could.

04:12.630 --> 04:13.410
But no matter what,

04:13.470 --> 04:14.660
I still need to remind you,

04:15.800 --> 04:17.020
the heart is flesh,

04:17.480 --> 04:17.930
not steel.

04:18.750 --> 04:19.780
You can forge and temper steel,

04:21.360 --> 04:22.930
but once a heart breaks,

04:24.800 --> 04:25.810
it never heals.

04:32.000 --> 04:32.730
That hurts.

04:32.870 --> 04:33.580
Are you okay,

04:33.920 --> 04:34.340
Jie?

04:34.920 --> 04:36.340
I'm fine.

04:36.510 --> 04:38.460
If he doesn't like it, don't force him.

04:38.630 --> 04:39.900
Who's forcing him?

04:40.480 --> 04:41.660
He insists on practicing.

04:42.040 --> 04:43.580
The more it hurts, the more he goes at it.

04:45.510 --> 04:46.050
Jie,

04:46.830 --> 04:47.810
do you really like it that much?

04:48.870 --> 04:49.900
When I grow up,

04:50.240 --> 04:51.140
I wanna compete,

04:51.480 --> 04:53.370
make the Olympics, and win glory for the country.

04:54.480 --> 04:54.930
Jie,

04:55.390 --> 04:55.980
don't talk nonsense.

04:56.310 --> 04:57.490
You need to study hard.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.660
That way, when you're older, you can be Dad's right-hand man.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.730
I don't wanna be busy

05:01.800 --> 05:02.730
like Tianna.

05:02.870 --> 05:04.050
Studying's exhausting.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.140
I just wanna play.

05:06.630 --> 05:07.220
Watch out!

05:07.430 --> 05:08.100
Move, you two.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.020
Didn't you say their school

05:15.070 --> 05:16.810
did a potential model test on him?

05:17.190 --> 05:17.730
Let me see.

05:18.870 --> 05:19.930
He's still little.

05:19.950 --> 05:20.780
It doesn't count.

05:21.360 --> 05:22.540
Just let me see.

05:26.160 --> 05:26.540
This...

05:26.800 --> 05:27.170
Not really...

05:30.680 --> 05:31.490
What's this?

05:31.950 --> 05:33.250
Linguistic aptitude, logical aptitude,

05:33.310 --> 05:34.460
and management skills are all average.

05:35.240 --> 05:35.700
But

05:36.120 --> 05:38.140
spatial ability and athletic ability are outstanding.

05:45.190 --> 05:46.170
Do you really think

05:46.600 --> 05:47.810
Tianjie is more suited

05:48.000 --> 05:49.730
to take over Siwei Group than Tianna?

05:50.160 --> 05:51.810
If those two ever turn on each other,

05:53.040 --> 05:53.850
can you really

05:57.630 --> 05:58.930
live out your later years happily?

06:14.270 --> 06:15.410
There's a full team meeting tomorrow morning.

06:15.720 --> 06:16.700
We'll go over the project proposal.

06:16.800 --> 06:17.730
Is 10:30 okay for you?

06:18.750 --> 06:19.170
Chi?

06:21.600 --> 06:22.140
Chi?

06:25.270 --> 06:26.780
I zoned out. What were you saying?

06:30.720 --> 06:31.290
What's wrong?

06:32.510 --> 06:33.290
Are you just too tired?

06:34.190 --> 06:34.930
No.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.410
Tianna and Zhao Heng are going through a breakup.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.610
Zhao Heng's about to go on a long business trip to South America.

06:40.680 --> 06:41.610
I'm a little worried about them.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.610
From my experience,

06:46.000 --> 06:47.100
even with your best friends,

06:47.510 --> 06:48.610
when it comes to stuff like this,

06:48.830 --> 06:50.100
it's best to just listen.

06:51.630 --> 06:53.140
Whatever you do, don't give a strong opinion.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.460
Otherwise, whether they

06:54.630 --> 06:55.220
get back together

06:55.270 --> 06:56.140
or break up later,

06:56.950 --> 06:57.900
you'll be stuck in the middle

06:58.000 --> 06:58.700
and get on both their bad sides.

06:59.120 --> 07:00.540
But I don't wanna do that.

07:01.270 --> 07:02.850
That safe, cautious approach

07:02.920 --> 07:04.020
feels outdated to me.

07:04.310 --> 07:04.730
Look,

07:05.000 --> 07:06.490
clients pick a consulting firm

07:06.560 --> 07:07.730
because they want a clear stance

07:07.800 --> 07:08.700
and a definitive opinion.

07:09.160 --> 07:09.930
So as a friend,

07:10.000 --> 07:11.660
if I'm all wishy-washy right now,

07:12.600 --> 07:14.050
I feel like a bad friend.

07:16.270 --> 07:18.170
Even if I get on both their bad sides,

07:18.430 --> 07:19.490
that's a problem for later, right?

07:20.600 --> 07:21.730
But now it's killing me to just sit here

07:21.830 --> 07:22.460
and do nothing.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.020
I'm gonna go make a call.

07:28.070 --> 07:29.250
Give me ten minutes, and I'll be back to work.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.560
[Xu Chi]

07:55.950 --> 07:56.290
Hello?

07:56.600 --> 07:57.290
Are you at the airport?

07:57.920 --> 07:58.900
You know that too?

07:59.920 --> 08:00.610
You want me to bring you back

08:00.680 --> 08:01.540
souvenirs from South America?

08:02.000 --> 08:02.780
Be honest with me,

08:03.240 --> 08:04.170
when you picked up my call,

08:04.190 --> 08:05.170
were you really disappointed?

08:05.630 --> 08:06.730
You were hoping

08:06.750 --> 08:07.850
it was Tianna calling, right?

08:10.510 --> 08:12.170
She won't. With that temper of hers...

08:12.240 --> 08:13.250
Zhao Heng, listen to me.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.850
We all want equality

08:14.920 --> 08:15.730
in love.

08:15.800 --> 08:17.170
We all want to be evenly matched.

08:18.160 --> 08:18.900
But let me ask you,

08:19.950 --> 08:21.540
are you actually on equal footing with Tianna?

08:22.240 --> 08:23.410
You know her weak spot

08:23.480 --> 08:24.490
is that she never felt secure

08:24.600 --> 08:25.370
in her own family.

08:25.680 --> 08:26.100
And yet

08:26.750 --> 08:27.580
you went and did

08:27.600 --> 08:28.700
the one thing she hates most,

08:28.750 --> 08:30.370
and then expected her to treat you rationally.

08:30.950 --> 08:32.100
Tianna was with me

08:32.150 --> 08:32.980
before she came to find you.

08:33.550 --> 08:34.530
She thought

08:34.600 --> 08:35.460
her dad was riding you hard again,

08:35.510 --> 08:36.100
and she panicked.

08:36.480 --> 08:37.370
She almost twisted her ankle

08:37.440 --> 08:38.340
running to the parking lot.

08:38.390 --> 08:39.220
Did you know that?

08:40.240 --> 08:41.370
You said you lost the bet.

08:42.360 --> 08:43.770
Zhao Heng, is it really all or nothing for you

08:43.840 --> 08:44.820
when it comes to love?

08:45.270 --> 08:46.130
I know

08:46.600 --> 08:48.250
it's totally biased of me

08:48.670 --> 08:49.180
to come at you

08:49.270 --> 08:50.650
for taking Tianna's side right now.

08:52.600 --> 08:53.530
But as a friend,

08:53.600 --> 08:54.850
I really don't want you to regret this.

08:56.910 --> 08:57.850
In two months,

08:59.390 --> 09:00.610
love can snap

09:00.670 --> 09:01.220
like a thread.

09:01.750 --> 09:03.060
Even if you want to tie it back together,

09:04.270 --> 09:05.340
at ten thousand kilometers apart,

09:07.480 --> 09:08.300
can you even reach it?

09:20.180 --> 09:21.300
Oh, man.

09:21.960 --> 09:23.180
I pushed too hard on the toilet.

09:23.510 --> 09:24.100
Feeling a little dizzy.

09:25.750 --> 09:26.530
Doesn't your watch check

09:26.550 --> 09:27.180
blood pressure?

09:27.270 --> 09:27.940
Let me borrow it.

09:32.750 --> 09:33.220
Where's your watch?

09:33.870 --> 09:34.300
You lost it?

09:35.270 --> 09:35.580
Hold on.

09:35.630 --> 09:36.460
Let me track it on my phone.

09:37.960 --> 09:38.440
[Zhao Heng's Smartwatch]

09:38.510 --> 09:40.420
Parking lot P1?

09:42.390 --> 09:42.850
That's not right.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.300
We took a ride

09:45.390 --> 09:46.490
straight to the departures level.

09:47.120 --> 09:48.530
How's your watch in here?

09:50.720 --> 09:51.940
Maybe you left the watch in the car,

09:51.960 --> 09:53.980
and the driver went to P1 to wait for passengers?

09:55.360 --> 09:56.250
You're dead set

09:56.270 --> 09:57.250
on mooching off me.

09:57.790 --> 09:58.730
You're in no position to talk about equality.

09:58.790 --> 09:59.420
Bu Tianna!

10:05.320 --> 10:05.940
Where are you going?

10:05.980 --> 10:06.490
We're about to board!

10:59.740 --> 11:00.250
Tianna.

11:35.380 --> 11:36.490
When I said I wanted to break up,

11:38.030 --> 11:39.180
I was just acting out.

11:39.870 --> 11:40.850
I was gaslighting you.

11:42.020 --> 11:43.180
I wanted to make sure you couldn't leave me.

11:50.030 --> 11:50.980
But deep down, I know

11:54.030 --> 11:55.700
no one could ever replace you in my heart.

11:58.910 --> 11:59.580
So,

12:01.600 --> 12:02.460
will you forgive me?

12:08.240 --> 12:09.370
I'm not here for you.

12:10.030 --> 12:10.460
Right.

12:11.510 --> 12:12.370
You're just passing by.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.340
I'm the one who came for you.

12:17.600 --> 12:18.530
You scumbag.

12:19.360 --> 12:21.010
Why do you always tell me what sounds good?

12:22.910 --> 12:23.220
Yeah.

12:23.910 --> 12:24.490
I'm a scumbag.

12:25.440 --> 12:25.890
I'm awful.

12:26.510 --> 12:27.010
I'm trash.

12:27.870 --> 12:29.100
I had an ulterior motive this whole time.

12:30.080 --> 12:30.580
So,

12:34.030 --> 12:34.770
do you still love me?

13:17.510 --> 13:18.180
And then?

13:18.480 --> 13:19.220
What happened next?

13:20.120 --> 13:20.650
And then

13:21.150 --> 13:22.130
his colleague called

13:22.240 --> 13:23.180
and told Zhao Heng to board.

13:23.360 --> 13:24.490
Then he and Tianna agreed to

13:24.510 --> 13:25.650
video chat

13:25.720 --> 13:26.650
for at least half an hour every day.

13:26.720 --> 13:27.730
After that, Zhao Heng flew off.

13:29.440 --> 13:30.100
That's it?

13:31.440 --> 13:33.220
That's so not romantic.

13:33.600 --> 13:34.580
I figured Zhao Heng

13:34.630 --> 13:35.580
would've at least changed his ticket

13:35.630 --> 13:36.530
and stayed one more night.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.010
Or Bu Tianna

13:38.080 --> 13:38.650
would've bought a ticket

13:38.790 --> 13:40.060
and gone to Venezuela with him.

13:41.200 --> 13:41.730
Mr. Shen,

13:41.840 --> 13:43.530
you think this is some idol drama?

13:44.360 --> 13:45.300
Feelings matter, of course.

13:45.360 --> 13:46.460
But that's just between two people.

13:46.510 --> 13:47.130
Work

13:47.150 --> 13:48.220
involves the whole team.

13:48.270 --> 13:49.300
You've gotta make trade-offs.

13:50.910 --> 13:51.730
So,

13:51.790 --> 13:53.580
to you, consulting people,

13:54.030 --> 13:55.850
work always comes before love, huh?

13:57.240 --> 13:57.850
First,

13:57.910 --> 13:59.650
I partly agree with you.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.420
Second,

14:00.960 --> 14:02.220
I think I hear

14:02.270 --> 14:03.340
a little bitterness in there.

14:04.270 --> 14:05.010
Third,

14:05.320 --> 14:06.700
my boss

14:06.960 --> 14:07.890
is blowing up my phone.

14:08.000 --> 14:08.730
So I'm gonna head out.

14:08.840 --> 14:09.650
I'll leave you two to your date.

14:15.790 --> 14:17.250
Something's off.

14:19.440 --> 14:21.010
That girl's definitely got something going on.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.130
But she really is thoughtful.

14:24.440 --> 14:24.770
Oh,

14:25.030 --> 14:25.530
try this.

14:26.120 --> 14:26.610
Foie gras.

14:28.120 --> 14:28.980
It's a bit rich,

14:29.480 --> 14:30.820
but it's loaded with iron.

14:31.240 --> 14:31.940
Good for your blood.

14:32.080 --> 14:32.580
Try it.

14:34.240 --> 14:34.770
Good?

14:35.750 --> 14:36.460
Have some more.

14:38.670 --> 14:39.580
I wish you could take

14:39.600 --> 14:40.850
a vacation sometime.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.220
Then we'll go somewhere for a couple of days.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.700
We can find a nice

14:43.720 --> 14:44.610
lake or ocean

14:44.720 --> 14:45.700
and just relax.

14:46.510 --> 14:47.890
Lately, I've even dreamed

14:47.960 --> 14:48.770
about you kayaking with me.

14:48.840 --> 14:49.770
I was so happy.

14:50.200 --> 14:50.940
Then let's do this Saturday.

14:51.840 --> 14:52.180
No,

14:52.390 --> 14:52.890
if you don't...

14:55.750 --> 14:56.530
What, you don't want to?

14:58.790 --> 15:00.010
I'd love to.

15:00.750 --> 15:01.250
Really?

15:02.790 --> 15:03.100
Alright.

15:03.870 --> 15:04.580
I'll go find

15:04.600 --> 15:05.130
a romantic hotel

15:05.630 --> 15:06.580
tonight.

15:06.910 --> 15:08.060
Let's have ourselves a nice romantic time.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.180
Have some meat.

15:11.270 --> 15:11.980
I haven't finished this piece yet.

15:12.030 --> 15:12.370
You go ahead.

15:21.150 --> 15:21.700
What's wrong?

15:21.750 --> 15:22.890
Didn't sleep well last night?

15:23.870 --> 15:24.250
It was okay.

15:25.030 --> 15:25.340
By the way,

15:25.390 --> 15:26.340
tomorrow morning's meeting...

15:26.910 --> 15:28.180
I already coordinated with everyone else.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.700
10:30, meeting room A2.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.220
So how's the All Buy timeline

15:32.270 --> 15:32.940
coming along?

15:33.630 --> 15:34.610
I coordinated with Lele

15:34.670 --> 15:35.820
and got All Buy's side set up.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.700
Starting next Monday,

15:37.790 --> 15:39.010
it'll be Warehousing first,

15:39.080 --> 15:40.130
followed by Quality Assurance,

15:40.270 --> 15:41.940
and then R&D and Procurement middle office.

15:42.080 --> 15:42.770
The whole process

15:42.790 --> 15:43.940
should take about half a month.

15:44.480 --> 15:45.890
Then we can start

15:46.120 --> 15:47.370
updating and iterating the model.

15:47.840 --> 15:48.580
Nice.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.060
That's fast progress.

15:50.790 --> 15:51.490
Looks like

15:51.750 --> 15:52.940
things are fine on Bu Tianna's end?

15:54.720 --> 15:55.580
You guessed right.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.530
Good thing I didn't listen to you that day.

16:00.630 --> 16:01.300
Sorry.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.580
I guess

16:03.960 --> 16:05.100
I'm a bit old-school.

16:06.080 --> 16:06.420
Wait,

16:06.440 --> 16:07.650
why're you apologizing?

16:08.000 --> 16:09.100
I didn't mean it that way.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.340
I know you were just

16:11.440 --> 16:12.460
giving me

16:12.550 --> 16:13.180
a mature suggestion

16:13.390 --> 16:14.580
from where you stand.

16:15.150 --> 16:15.650
You mean it?

16:16.910 --> 16:17.580
Yes.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.250
What... what's wrong?

16:30.240 --> 16:31.460
I'm handing you my whole heart.

16:31.510 --> 16:32.060
Hear that?

16:34.550 --> 16:35.100
Is it real?

16:36.600 --> 16:37.340
So real.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.370
I'm so moved.

16:41.120 --> 16:42.180
You're putting it on.

16:42.180 --> 16:46.460
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

16:46.580 --> 16:51.620
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

16:51.700 --> 17:00.140
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

17:02.020 --> 17:06.820
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

17:07.780 --> 17:11.060
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

17:11.070 --> 17:11.920
[Testing]

17:12.340 --> 17:16.660
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

17:16.790 --> 17:17.180
Mr. Liu,

17:17.440 --> 17:17.860
thank you.

17:18.200 --> 17:18.770
No worries.

17:19.510 --> 17:20.010
Mr. Ye,

17:20.550 --> 17:22.460
after you guys optimize this process,

17:22.680 --> 17:23.660
will there be any side effects?

17:24.350 --> 17:25.090
Don't worry.

17:25.400 --> 17:26.330
It'll only boost efficiency.

17:26.590 --> 17:27.730
Won't cause any trouble.

17:28.550 --> 17:28.940
Alright.

17:28.940 --> 17:32.540
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

17:32.660 --> 17:37.620
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

17:37.740 --> 17:38.860
♪Together with me♪

17:38.880 --> 17:39.810
Based on the AI model

17:39.880 --> 17:40.860
we developed at Hezong,

17:41.000 --> 17:42.140
[All Buy]
when All Buy goes overseas,

17:42.200 --> 17:42.860
they should focus

17:42.960 --> 17:44.660
on packaged foods,

17:44.750 --> 17:45.460
mainly snack foods

17:45.480 --> 17:46.810
and instant grains and oils.

17:47.110 --> 17:47.940
For where to land,

17:48.000 --> 17:49.620
I'd suggest major cities with dense Chinese

17:49.680 --> 17:50.730
and international student populations,

17:51.110 --> 17:52.050
because these products

17:52.110 --> 17:53.570
keep well and are easy to ship.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.980
Plus, we can use AI for both quality inspection

17:55.110 --> 17:56.090
and quality assurance.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.140
That can massively boost efficiency

17:57.440 --> 17:58.290
and cut the labor costs

17:58.350 --> 17:59.180
of setting up overseas

17:59.240 --> 17:59.900
quality control centers.

18:01.790 --> 18:02.420
Put together

18:02.440 --> 18:03.860
[09:28]
the overseas e-commerce proposal

18:03.880 --> 18:04.420
for All Buy.

18:04.640 --> 18:05.290
Okay, got it.

18:06.110 --> 18:06.660
And take a look at this.

18:08.350 --> 18:09.660
Let's go over this.

18:10.830 --> 18:11.660
I was gonna bring it up too.

18:11.720 --> 18:12.530
Just help me

18:12.550 --> 18:13.220
adjust all of these.

18:13.510 --> 18:13.810
Okay?

18:14.110 --> 18:14.900
Everyone's tired, right?

18:15.070 --> 18:16.140
I bought coffee and milk tea

18:16.160 --> 18:16.810
for everyone.

18:16.960 --> 18:17.860
Take a break.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.770
- Thanks, Mr. Kai. - Thanks, Mr. Kai.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.290
Made this especially for you.

18:24.510 --> 18:26.050
Your favorite.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.570
Triple espresso with whiskey.

18:28.590 --> 18:29.980
Hand-poured Irish. Did I remember right?

18:30.830 --> 18:31.290
Thanks.

18:31.790 --> 18:32.090
Sit.

18:33.680 --> 18:34.900
So, how much longer

18:35.310 --> 18:36.810
till we see the light at the end of the tunnel?

18:37.310 --> 18:37.660
Soon.

18:38.590 --> 18:39.290
All Buy's feedback

18:39.350 --> 18:40.090
has been pretty good.

18:40.270 --> 18:41.290
They got inspired by us

18:41.640 --> 18:42.700
and plan to use the AI vendor

18:42.720 --> 18:43.490
we recommended

18:43.640 --> 18:44.980
to overhaul their

18:45.030 --> 18:46.140
domestic backend,

18:46.200 --> 18:47.460
both warehousing and outlets.

18:47.790 --> 18:49.490
I figure two weeks at most,

18:50.310 --> 18:51.330
and we can do the official delivery.

18:52.720 --> 18:54.770
We do their overseas consulting,

18:54.830 --> 18:56.660
and they just port it over domestically.

18:57.270 --> 18:58.770
They're getting a steal.

18:58.920 --> 18:59.940
One consulting fee; double the usage.

19:00.160 --> 19:00.980
No choice.

19:01.550 --> 19:03.330
Just treat it as free advertising.

19:03.550 --> 19:05.700
All Buy is practically a stepping stone

19:05.790 --> 19:07.660
for Hezong to break into the tech giant ecosystem.

19:08.110 --> 19:08.530
Anyway,

19:08.590 --> 19:09.660
as long as this delivery succeeds,

19:10.000 --> 19:10.980
we won't have to worry about future deals.

19:11.070 --> 19:12.490
Okay, I'm waiting for your victory news.

19:14.510 --> 19:14.980
By the way, Mr. Kai...

19:16.880 --> 19:18.220
After this project wraps,

19:19.440 --> 19:20.770
I want to take a month-long vacation.

19:32.440 --> 19:33.010
No problem.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.770
A month? Seriously?

19:44.160 --> 19:44.530
Yeah.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.140
I already gave Mr. Kai a heads-up.

19:47.030 --> 19:47.570
Just so HR can easily

19:47.590 --> 19:48.530
sign off on your time off.

19:49.030 --> 19:50.090
That's great!

19:50.830 --> 19:51.770
When I said

19:51.790 --> 19:52.860
I had no time to hang out,

19:53.000 --> 19:54.180
you looked so down,

19:54.240 --> 19:55.220
like a sad golden retriever.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.700
It actually made me feel kinda bad.

19:57.480 --> 19:57.980
Great.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.810
Finally, we get some time

19:58.830 --> 19:59.620
just for us.

20:00.400 --> 20:00.700
By the way,

20:02.110 --> 20:02.730
where do you wanna go?

20:04.110 --> 20:04.810
Let me think.

20:08.680 --> 20:10.900
Southeast Asia's too close.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.090
South America's far.

20:13.200 --> 20:14.250
But Tianna and Zhao Heng said

20:14.270 --> 20:15.530
they couldn't get used to the food there.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.380
How about Saudi Arabia?

20:20.240 --> 20:21.010
When I was little,

20:21.070 --> 20:22.010
I loved this comic

20:22.070 --> 20:23.090
my mom left me.

20:23.510 --> 20:24.900
There was a tower that reached for the heavens.

20:25.510 --> 20:26.420
My mom said

20:26.480 --> 20:28.420
date palms grew in a row at the bottom.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.180
The dates were sweet as honey.

20:30.350 --> 20:31.250
She loved eating them.

20:34.640 --> 20:36.730
The yellow spiral tower?

20:36.790 --> 20:37.380
Yes, that one.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.860
That's in Iraq,

20:39.960 --> 20:40.620
not Saudi.

20:45.990 --> 20:47.300
We'd have to take so many days off, though.

20:47.560 --> 20:48.770
Chi, if you wanna go,

20:49.150 --> 20:50.330
we can take as many days off as we need.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.410
Forget it, forget it.

20:56.200 --> 20:57.460
Even if we can get the time off,

20:58.040 --> 20:59.500
getting there would be a hassle.

21:01.400 --> 21:02.050
Where do you wanna go?

21:02.880 --> 21:03.620
I love the ocean.

21:04.310 --> 21:06.810
I wanna go to the Blue Hole in Dahab.

21:07.550 --> 21:09.010
They also call it the Eye of the Ocean.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.140
It's the easiest deep blue sea cave

21:11.590 --> 21:12.940
for tourists to get to.

21:13.310 --> 21:14.420
Then let's go there.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.900
We've got a whole month.

21:17.350 --> 21:18.570
We can hit the Tower of Babel first,

21:18.720 --> 21:19.660
then the Blue Hole.

21:20.160 --> 21:20.860
They say

21:20.920 --> 21:22.420
that the Tower of Babel is where humans

21:22.550 --> 21:23.660
get closest to the heavens.

21:24.070 --> 21:24.810
We could go from

21:25.000 --> 21:26.940
the highest point on Earth

21:27.480 --> 21:28.770
straight to the deepest.

21:31.270 --> 21:32.290
How do you

21:32.310 --> 21:33.860
make everything

21:34.160 --> 21:35.810
sound so poetic?

21:40.960 --> 21:42.250
Must be that mature man charm

21:43.200 --> 21:44.180
you talked about.

21:48.240 --> 21:49.380
You're so petty,

21:50.000 --> 21:51.380
and you hold grudges.

21:52.030 --> 21:52.570
Yeah.

21:53.240 --> 21:53.860
I hold grudges.

21:54.830 --> 21:55.700
And right now,

21:56.000 --> 21:56.900
I'm getting revenge.

21:57.270 --> 21:57.980
Here I come!

21:59.480 --> 22:01.330
What are you doing? We have to get up early tomorrow.

22:27.830 --> 22:31.050
Go from the highest point on Earth...

22:43.350 --> 22:45.330
We could go from

22:48.030 --> 22:50.900
the highest point on Earth...

22:56.750 --> 22:57.860
[I'm in Beijing]
It's that supervisor surnamed Liu

22:57.920 --> 22:58.810
from All Buy's quality inspection department.

22:59.400 --> 23:00.180
Before it happened,

23:00.200 --> 23:01.090
he posted a farewell video

23:01.110 --> 23:02.050
on a video app.

23:02.510 --> 23:03.810
Said All Buy and Hezong teamed up

23:03.880 --> 23:04.660
to force him out.

23:05.680 --> 23:07.220
That consultant Ye

23:08.200 --> 23:10.090
swore up and down

23:10.440 --> 23:11.460
that after optimizing the process,

23:11.830 --> 23:13.940
[Statement]
it wouldn't cause us any trouble.

23:14.680 --> 23:16.250
What a liar.

23:18.750 --> 23:20.770
We're exactly the trouble

23:20.830 --> 23:23.660
All Buy wants to cut loose!

23:28.880 --> 23:30.010
Word is, Mr. Liu

23:30.070 --> 23:31.530
has over three million in mortgage debt.

23:31.640 --> 23:32.660
His kid's still in the hospital.

23:32.920 --> 23:34.380
That AI quality inspection system

23:34.480 --> 23:35.900
All Buy brought in

23:36.160 --> 23:37.460
uses robotic electronic eyes

23:37.550 --> 23:38.380
and probes

23:38.440 --> 23:39.420
to replace human inspectors.

23:39.790 --> 23:41.180
One machine can replace

23:41.270 --> 23:42.330
fifty quality inspectors.

23:42.590 --> 23:43.380
[Hotspot Intel]
So listen up, folks,

23:43.680 --> 23:44.140
AI

23:44.160 --> 23:45.250
doesn't just revolutionize industries.

23:45.510 --> 23:46.620
It can cost lives.

23:46.790 --> 23:48.290
- Mr. Su. - Mr. Su!

23:48.310 --> 23:49.290
Is what Mr. Liu said

23:49.310 --> 23:50.250
in his video true?

23:50.680 --> 23:51.860
Did your company spend a fortune

23:51.920 --> 23:52.770
hiring consultants to lay people off,

23:52.790 --> 23:53.570
instead of giving old employees

23:53.590 --> 23:54.180
fair compensation?

23:54.480 --> 23:55.010
Please answer directly.

23:55.070 --> 23:55.490
Mr. Su.

23:55.720 --> 23:56.660
Please answer directly.

23:56.680 --> 23:56.940
Mr. Su.

23:57.200 --> 23:58.420
Mr. Su. Did someone die at your company?

23:58.680 --> 23:59.290
Did someone jump?

24:09.440 --> 24:10.220
Are you sure HR

24:10.240 --> 24:11.140
never pressured him to resign?

24:11.480 --> 24:11.860
Yes.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.810
That's not what you told us back then.

24:13.920 --> 24:14.700
This all happened so suddenly.

24:14.750 --> 24:15.700
Fine. I'll talk to Mr. Ye.

24:16.750 --> 24:17.460
I understand.

24:20.000 --> 24:20.620
There you are.

24:21.960 --> 24:22.700
The hospital said

24:22.830 --> 24:23.330
Mr. Liu

24:23.350 --> 24:24.090
is out of the ICU.

24:24.480 --> 24:26.140
He hit a light sign on the 29th floor,

24:26.200 --> 24:27.290
then landed on a platform on the 7th.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.250
He's not in any danger.

24:29.440 --> 24:29.940
Thank god.

24:30.680 --> 24:31.490
I'm going to see him right now.

24:32.310 --> 24:32.900
I'll come with you.

24:35.030 --> 24:35.490
Xu Chi!

24:36.350 --> 24:37.530
All Buy's on the line for you.

24:39.590 --> 24:40.860
You go ahead. I'll catch up.

24:43.110 --> 24:43.730
Richard!

24:46.750 --> 24:47.620
Are you going to the hospital?

24:50.480 --> 24:51.810
The crisis PR team is already there.

24:51.880 --> 24:52.660
You don't need to go.

24:54.680 --> 24:55.330
Mr. Kai,

24:57.030 --> 24:57.860
I want to apologize

24:58.830 --> 24:59.620
to Mr. Liu in person.

25:00.960 --> 25:02.730
We've always handled overseas projects.

25:02.790 --> 25:04.660
Domestic projects have always been yours.

25:04.830 --> 25:06.050
We can't take this one.

25:10.200 --> 25:11.460
You're back already?

25:14.920 --> 25:15.660
Mr. Kai said

25:16.310 --> 25:17.250
I'm not ready to go yet.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.380
I get how that video

25:19.440 --> 25:20.250
affected you.

25:20.830 --> 25:21.530
But

25:21.640 --> 25:22.980
you need to control your guilt.

25:23.510 --> 25:25.220
Mr. Liu didn't mention your name.

25:25.510 --> 25:26.530
If you go apologize now,

25:26.590 --> 25:28.220
you're taking all the blame

25:28.270 --> 25:29.460
on yourself.

25:29.750 --> 25:30.940
He just got stuck

25:31.240 --> 25:32.490
in his own head for a moment.

25:32.590 --> 25:34.050
He's fine now.

25:36.350 --> 25:36.860
Mr. Kai,

25:38.350 --> 25:39.330
that's a human life.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.050
Okay.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.490
I get how you feel.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.050
It's like, I didn't kill him,

25:44.070 --> 25:45.090
but he died because of me.

25:45.350 --> 25:47.180
But how we handle this case now

25:48.270 --> 25:49.700
isn't just about Mr. Liu.

25:49.830 --> 25:51.250
It's about billions in business,

25:51.480 --> 25:54.010
and new jobs for hundreds of employees.

25:55.110 --> 25:56.290
Don't lose sight of the big picture.

25:58.480 --> 25:58.980
Mr. Kai.

26:00.480 --> 26:01.460
I'm a partner.

26:02.350 --> 26:03.140
This is my project.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.620
I get first say over this!

26:09.160 --> 26:10.570
There are a lot of reporters outside the hospital.

26:10.750 --> 26:11.900
If you go now, you could cause

26:11.920 --> 26:12.770
irreversible second-hand harm

26:12.830 --> 26:13.980
to Mr. Liu and his family.

26:14.070 --> 26:15.420
Have you thought about that?

26:16.720 --> 26:17.730
Setting aside that I'm your boss,

26:18.240 --> 26:19.220
as a friend,

26:19.270 --> 26:21.140
I'm suggesting you go home and rest.

26:21.440 --> 26:23.140
Wait till you're in a better place

26:23.240 --> 26:24.980
and PR has things under control.

26:25.070 --> 26:26.250
It won't be too late then.

26:26.550 --> 26:27.220
But Mr. Kai...

26:27.270 --> 26:27.860
Enough!

26:28.400 --> 26:29.290
Richard, I've got a lot of fires

26:29.310 --> 26:30.090
to put out right now.

26:30.310 --> 26:31.490
Can you just give it a rest?

26:33.240 --> 26:33.860
Chi,

26:34.750 --> 26:36.570
actually, back when we were on the Yuanzhou project,

26:37.400 --> 26:38.570
I started thinking about something.

26:40.160 --> 26:41.330
We in consulting

26:42.640 --> 26:44.460
shouldn't just be responsible to the companies we serve.

26:45.550 --> 26:47.330
We should be responsible to the actual people.

26:49.720 --> 26:50.420
So

26:51.880 --> 26:53.090
I have to go apologize to Mr. Liu.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.460
Whether Mr. Kai agrees or not,

26:56.070 --> 26:56.700
I'm going.

27:03.750 --> 27:04.770
I'll go with you then.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.570
Are you okay?

27:13.030 --> 27:14.220
You seem

27:14.240 --> 27:14.860
a little off today.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.090
You just mentioned Yuanzhou.

27:18.920 --> 27:20.180
Were you thinking about Wen Ruosen?

27:22.400 --> 27:23.660
My kid's only eight.

27:24.960 --> 27:26.140
I really don't want to jump off a building.

27:26.880 --> 27:27.940
But if you don't save me,

27:28.720 --> 27:30.090
I really will jump.

27:32.550 --> 27:33.980
Before, you didn't want to be

27:34.030 --> 27:34.620
too hard on him

27:35.270 --> 27:36.530
after hearing that he wanted to jump.

27:37.200 --> 27:37.810
You...

27:43.920 --> 27:44.810
It's on me.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.010
Alright then.

27:50.550 --> 27:51.620
I'll explain it all to you sometime.

28:02.590 --> 28:04.010
PR says someone from Xinrui Finance

28:04.030 --> 28:04.900
is coming to interview soon.

28:05.110 --> 28:05.810
Are you up for it?

28:09.400 --> 28:10.530
Why don't you go home and rest?

28:10.590 --> 28:11.380
I'll handle things here.

28:14.590 --> 28:15.180
Thanks.

28:17.350 --> 28:18.250
Hezong's bid

28:18.310 --> 28:20.220
was only for All Buy's overseas projects.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.420
As for personnel changes

28:21.480 --> 28:22.330
in the client's domestic

28:22.350 --> 28:23.420
business department,

28:23.480 --> 28:25.220
we don't have more detailed information.

28:25.680 --> 28:27.420
So, does Hezong bear any responsibility

28:27.510 --> 28:28.700
for All Buy's jumping incident?

28:30.720 --> 28:32.180
I'm not at liberty to answer that.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.660
This is an internal matter

28:33.720 --> 28:34.980
for All Buy.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.330
Hezong only offered suggestions

28:37.400 --> 28:38.490
for their overseas projects.

28:52.140 --> 28:54.900
[Young Ye Xinzhi]

29:15.920 --> 29:16.460
Mr. Kai,

29:16.720 --> 29:17.730
that's a human life.

29:18.590 --> 29:20.290
Hezong is a top consulting firm.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.620
And I'm the project lead.

29:23.070 --> 29:24.050
I think we have an obligation

29:24.440 --> 29:25.330
to apologize to the victim

29:25.790 --> 29:27.140
and admit our mistakes to the public.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.050
This is what we have to do!

29:28.070 --> 29:29.420
No, no!

29:30.790 --> 29:31.660
We didn't make a mistake.

29:32.110 --> 29:33.050
Consulting firms

29:33.070 --> 29:33.860
are only advisors,

29:33.920 --> 29:34.620
never the party involved.

29:35.350 --> 29:36.570
Your team provided a business

29:37.030 --> 29:38.330
process integration plan for overseas expansion

29:38.400 --> 29:39.980
that hasn't even been implemented yet.

29:40.160 --> 29:40.980
Mr. Liu's issue

29:41.160 --> 29:42.330
happened because All Buy

29:42.350 --> 29:42.860
messed things up

29:42.880 --> 29:43.940
while using AI to overhaul

29:44.000 --> 29:44.490
their workflow.

29:44.550 --> 29:46.050
It has nothing to do with Hezong.

30:01.300 --> 30:04.160
[Hezong Consulting]

30:04.590 --> 30:05.050
Xu Chi.

30:06.070 --> 30:06.460
Xu Chi?

30:07.440 --> 30:08.050
Got a minute?

30:08.200 --> 30:08.900
Let's talk.

30:11.680 --> 30:12.570
I want to know

30:13.000 --> 30:14.010
how you assess

30:14.310 --> 30:15.290
the impact of this All Buy incident

30:15.510 --> 30:16.420
on the company.

30:16.960 --> 30:18.010
Richard and I both think...

30:18.070 --> 30:18.460
Sorry.

30:18.750 --> 30:20.010
I just want to hear your personal opinion.

30:20.070 --> 30:21.860
Objective, calm, concise,

30:21.920 --> 30:22.620
and neutral.

30:26.310 --> 30:29.140
My personal stance...

30:31.270 --> 30:32.700
It's hard for me to be completely neutral.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.290
Because this whole thing

30:34.480 --> 30:35.490
has affected me a lot too.

30:36.480 --> 30:38.730
I can only try my best to calmly

30:39.070 --> 30:40.380
share some of my observations with you.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.090
Public opinion

30:45.160 --> 30:46.330
isn't a big deal right now.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.010
Because to

30:47.070 --> 30:48.330
everyday people,

30:48.720 --> 30:50.140
Hezong and industry consultants

30:50.200 --> 30:51.530
are still pretty unfamiliar concepts.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.490
But long term,

30:53.880 --> 30:54.770
the industry will have

30:54.830 --> 30:56.220
negative views of Hezong

30:56.310 --> 30:57.660
for at least half a year, maybe more.

30:59.920 --> 31:00.900
That's a very precise analysis.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.140
But still too conservative.

31:04.000 --> 31:06.050
Hezong ranked number one

31:06.550 --> 31:07.660
in sales among domestic

31:07.720 --> 31:08.530
consulting firms last year,

31:09.240 --> 31:09.770
but with the European

31:09.830 --> 31:10.940
and American markets shrinking,

31:11.440 --> 31:12.620
our business volume has dropped sharply.

31:17.510 --> 31:18.490
You can scroll down.

31:21.440 --> 31:22.420
To say the least,

31:22.640 --> 31:24.570
Hezong is facing its winter right now.

31:25.160 --> 31:27.090
The only ones with consulting budgets now

31:27.160 --> 31:28.090
[Hezong Consulting]
are the big internet firms.

31:28.270 --> 31:29.330
[Global Revenue Analysis by Region]
So I'm really counting

31:29.590 --> 31:30.620
on Richard's

31:30.790 --> 31:32.050
All Buy project to deliver smoothly,

31:32.350 --> 31:33.010
become the company's

31:33.030 --> 31:34.010
new breakthrough,

31:34.790 --> 31:35.860
and lead other business

31:35.960 --> 31:36.660
lines upward.

31:39.830 --> 31:40.700
If Richard apologizes

31:41.070 --> 31:41.980
and takes responsibility

31:42.350 --> 31:43.770
out of personal impulse,

31:44.550 --> 31:45.700
it could very well affect

31:45.790 --> 31:47.090
the whole project moving forward.

31:47.790 --> 31:48.980
If All Buy

31:49.400 --> 31:50.570
ends our cooperation

31:50.640 --> 31:51.700
because of this,

31:51.750 --> 31:52.980
our internet projects

31:53.270 --> 31:54.460
will take a major hit.

31:54.920 --> 31:55.770
What we lose then

31:56.310 --> 31:57.900
isn't just your team's effort

31:58.960 --> 31:59.380
and money,

32:00.350 --> 32:01.290
but Hezong's future.

32:06.070 --> 32:06.660
I understand.

32:09.310 --> 32:10.570
Give me a little time.

32:10.640 --> 32:11.570
I'll talk to him.

32:12.070 --> 32:13.490
Make sure he keeps his emotions in check.

32:13.590 --> 32:13.860
No.

32:14.400 --> 32:16.730
What I need is for you to fully take over

32:16.790 --> 32:17.620
the All Buy project,

32:17.680 --> 32:19.220
completely shut down this incident,

32:19.640 --> 32:21.010
and keep fulfilling the consulting contract.

32:21.070 --> 32:22.770
And Richard absolutely cannot know.

32:25.110 --> 32:26.250
I can't do that. Absolutely not.

32:28.750 --> 32:30.140
Xu Chi, you know him better than I do.

32:30.880 --> 32:32.180
But I've known him for over ten years.

32:32.350 --> 32:33.290
I've never seen him

32:33.350 --> 32:34.420
lose it like this

32:34.440 --> 32:35.180
on any project.

32:36.160 --> 32:38.330
I guess Mr. Liu's jump

32:38.590 --> 32:39.660
triggered severe

32:39.720 --> 32:40.530
PTSD in him.

32:40.830 --> 32:41.730
Just now, I asked him

32:41.830 --> 32:42.770
to follow PR's arrangements.

32:42.790 --> 32:43.730
His reaction was intense.

32:43.790 --> 32:44.570
Public opinion is on fire.

32:44.640 --> 32:45.250
For the company's sake,

32:45.270 --> 32:46.330
I have to sideline him for now.

32:47.480 --> 32:48.770
You're the number two on the team.

32:49.240 --> 32:50.530
I want you to step up in this crisis,

32:50.590 --> 32:51.330
handle the client,

32:51.400 --> 32:52.530
manage the fallout,

32:52.680 --> 32:53.810
and deliver the final results.

32:55.590 --> 32:57.530
Mr. Kai, I really can't.

32:58.000 --> 32:58.530
This project...

32:58.550 --> 32:59.900
Xu Chi, I hope you understand this.

33:00.510 --> 33:01.460
If you don't take over,

33:01.720 --> 33:02.770
I'll assign

33:02.830 --> 33:03.620
someone else.

33:03.790 --> 33:04.940
Another lead

33:05.160 --> 33:06.250
won't care what happens to him

33:06.310 --> 33:07.380
or look out for him.

33:08.030 --> 33:09.140
If they need him to take the fall,

33:09.160 --> 33:10.490
I'll just nod along.

33:12.680 --> 33:13.900
And he'll face the biggest failure

33:13.960 --> 33:14.900
of his career.

33:15.400 --> 33:16.530
You're the closest person to him.

33:16.880 --> 33:18.620
Are you just gonna stand by and watch him

33:18.920 --> 33:19.940
get replaced,

33:20.160 --> 33:20.940
only for him to wake up

33:20.960 --> 33:21.900
and regret it for the rest of his life?

33:29.110 --> 33:30.140
Business is war.

33:30.550 --> 33:31.620
When the general is out of form,

33:31.830 --> 33:33.980
the second-in-command should take over.

33:34.110 --> 33:34.900
Because he knows

33:35.310 --> 33:37.050
all the general wants is victory.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.180
We in consulting

33:39.510 --> 33:39.860
shouldn't just

33:39.920 --> 33:41.250
be responsible to the companies we serve.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.220
We should be responsible to the actual people.

33:47.640 --> 33:48.140
I have to

33:48.160 --> 33:48.900
go apologize to Mr. Liu.

33:49.590 --> 33:50.940
Whether Mr. Kai agrees or not,

33:51.480 --> 33:52.050
I'm going.

33:54.510 --> 33:56.140
I'm not caving because of your threat.

33:57.160 --> 33:58.250
I want to make

33:58.510 --> 33:59.490
Ye Xinzhi's vision a reality.

34:00.030 --> 34:01.050
If I step up now,

34:03.200 --> 34:04.330
what support will the company give me?

34:04.830 --> 34:05.700
I'll give you two promises.

34:05.750 --> 34:06.140
First,

34:06.350 --> 34:07.570
you can mobilize

34:07.680 --> 34:08.610
all of Hezong's resources.

34:08.670 --> 34:09.610
I'll personally coordinate for you.

34:09.670 --> 34:10.050
Second,

34:10.670 --> 34:11.610
if the project delivers smoothly,

34:12.800 --> 34:13.860
you'll be promoted to project manager.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.690
Xinzhi.

35:05.320 --> 35:06.210
How come you're back so early?

35:06.590 --> 35:07.420
I was worried about you.

35:09.360 --> 35:11.090
So I came back to check on you.

35:13.590 --> 35:14.940
I have to head back to the office soon.

35:16.550 --> 35:17.420
I'll go with you.

35:19.960 --> 35:20.820
You should rest.

35:21.190 --> 35:21.780
I've got this.

35:22.630 --> 35:23.460
I got you some chicken soup.

35:23.510 --> 35:24.130
You want some?

35:25.360 --> 35:25.780
Thanks.

35:33.630 --> 35:34.090
It's good.

35:36.670 --> 35:37.380
Have more, then.

35:41.320 --> 35:41.820
Chi.

35:43.670 --> 35:45.130
Once I've apologized

35:45.360 --> 35:46.210
to Mr. Liu,

35:46.960 --> 35:48.380
I'm giving up my cut of the profits

35:48.480 --> 35:48.980
from this project.

35:49.960 --> 35:51.090
We can use it to compensate Mr. Liu

35:51.480 --> 35:52.380
or set up

35:52.440 --> 35:54.820
a charity fund for All Buy.

35:55.710 --> 35:56.420
Either way,

35:56.880 --> 35:57.780
I want to minimize

35:57.880 --> 35:59.690
the fallout of this shake-up

35:59.880 --> 36:00.570
for the ground-level staff.

36:03.760 --> 36:04.460
Do you think that works?

36:06.670 --> 36:07.210
Of course.

36:08.960 --> 36:09.690
I'll donate mine too.

36:10.070 --> 36:11.210
I don't need to buy that apartment anyway.

36:16.840 --> 36:17.380
Xinzhi,

36:18.590 --> 36:20.010
let me take over everything

36:21.070 --> 36:22.420
on this project going forward, okay?

36:23.510 --> 36:24.170
We'll go see Mr. Liu

36:24.190 --> 36:25.010
in a day or two.

36:31.070 --> 36:32.260
Don't go online

36:33.070 --> 36:33.900
today.

36:35.000 --> 36:37.090
And stay off the work group chats.

36:37.920 --> 36:38.460
Wait for me to come back.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.380
I'll wait for you.

36:42.960 --> 36:43.940
Xinzhi, trust me.

36:44.110 --> 36:44.940
I'll do everything I can

36:45.000 --> 36:46.210
to help you,

36:46.630 --> 36:47.260
to help us.

36:48.110 --> 36:48.650
I don't even know

36:48.670 --> 36:49.780
if I can pull this off.

36:50.840 --> 36:53.340
If I do something you don't like,

36:54.710 --> 36:55.610
don't be mad at me.

36:56.630 --> 36:57.170
Everything I do

36:57.190 --> 36:58.380
is for our future.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.300
Of course I trust you.

37:11.030 --> 37:12.380
When my ears were messed up,

37:13.630 --> 37:14.530
you healed me.

37:16.320 --> 37:16.980
This time,

37:18.230 --> 37:19.170
I'll be your support.

37:31.920 --> 37:32.460
Thanks.

38:08.520 --> 38:09.200
[All Buy Project Work Group Chat]

38:11.230 --> 38:12.840
[Ye Xinzhi]

38:15.600 --> 38:16.900
[Remove group member Ye Xinzhi? Only the removed member will be notified.]

38:16.900 --> 38:17.260
[Remove]

38:26.200 --> 38:29.240
[All Buy]

38:31.480 --> 38:33.010
This approach is too risky.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.380
Admitting to the media

38:35.400 --> 38:36.340
that we're responsible

38:36.360 --> 38:36.980
for an employee's suicide?

38:37.480 --> 38:38.530
Isn't that basically

38:38.590 --> 38:39.490
brand suicide

38:39.590 --> 38:40.300
for All Buy?

38:41.800 --> 38:43.010
Hezong's many cases

38:43.070 --> 38:43.650
prove

38:43.760 --> 38:45.690
that honesty is the best way

38:45.760 --> 38:46.860
to handle public scrutiny.

38:47.880 --> 38:48.740
And morally and logically,

38:48.760 --> 38:49.460
don't we owe the public

38:49.510 --> 38:50.170
an explanation?

38:50.360 --> 38:51.780
That was then, and this is now!

38:52.230 --> 38:53.300
Your plan is nothing but a gamble!

38:53.760 --> 38:54.610
Can you honestly prove

38:54.840 --> 38:55.460
there's no risk

38:55.550 --> 38:56.130
if we go your way?

38:56.510 --> 38:57.340
And Mr. Kai

38:57.480 --> 38:58.260
would never stand

38:58.360 --> 38:59.530
for both sides taking the blame!

38:59.670 --> 39:00.300
Mr. Kai gave me

39:00.360 --> 39:01.210
full authority

39:01.280 --> 39:01.980
to handle this.

39:02.030 --> 39:03.050
My decision

39:03.440 --> 39:04.570
is his decision.

39:04.880 --> 39:06.300
And I can't guarantee a thing.

39:06.360 --> 39:07.380
Because in business,

39:07.440 --> 39:08.340
every second

39:08.440 --> 39:09.380
carries risk.

39:10.360 --> 39:11.380
But have you thought

39:11.800 --> 39:13.490
about what would happen if Hezong didn't stick

39:13.760 --> 39:14.780
to the principle of consultants

39:14.800 --> 39:16.090
standing with their clients?

39:16.230 --> 39:16.900
Why are we sitting here

39:16.920 --> 39:17.460
right now?

39:18.070 --> 39:19.530
Because Richard and I both believe

39:19.760 --> 39:20.940
we should take on the responsibility

39:21.230 --> 39:22.090
we ought to.

39:24.150 --> 39:24.650
Mr. Su,

39:25.630 --> 39:26.690
we are no longer just

39:26.710 --> 39:27.860
a service provider.

39:28.710 --> 39:29.860
We are a partner standing

39:29.920 --> 39:31.650
shoulder to shoulder with you.

39:32.760 --> 39:33.940
If All Buy is taking a gamble,

39:34.400 --> 39:35.690
then by standing

39:35.760 --> 39:36.530
with you tomorrow,

39:37.150 --> 39:38.050
Hezong is putting its reputation

39:38.110 --> 39:39.300
in the industry on the line as well.

40:04.800 --> 40:05.780
It's almost midnight.

40:06.110 --> 40:07.130
I think we're all tired.

40:07.480 --> 40:09.650
I don't see any point

40:09.710 --> 40:11.460
in dragging out this pointless argument.

40:12.030 --> 40:12.460
Alright then.

40:14.110 --> 40:15.130
We need your official response

40:15.230 --> 40:16.170
by 2 AM.

40:18.510 --> 40:19.820
Sorry. We need to head out.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.460
Mr. Su.

40:32.800 --> 40:33.820
In the business world,

40:33.920 --> 40:34.940
no company

40:35.320 --> 40:36.170
is irreplaceable.

40:36.630 --> 40:37.130
If All Buy

40:37.150 --> 40:38.420
can get through this,

40:38.960 --> 40:40.210
the sky's the limit.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.010
But if it can't,

40:42.440 --> 40:43.490
I'm sure All Buy's

40:43.550 --> 40:44.300
competitors

40:44.360 --> 40:45.610
will gladly step up.

40:46.230 --> 40:46.980
And when that happens,

40:48.630 --> 40:49.260
Hezong will

40:49.320 --> 40:50.170
serve them

40:50.510 --> 40:51.420
with the same professionalism.

41:03.760 --> 41:04.820
Are we really just leaving like this?

41:07.800 --> 41:08.340
Miss Xu.

41:10.510 --> 41:11.130
Wait a second.

41:16.190 --> 41:17.650
Please get us a printer.

41:17.760 --> 41:18.900
By 10 AM tomorrow,

41:18.960 --> 41:19.740
we'll have

41:19.880 --> 41:20.860
a game plan

41:20.920 --> 41:21.460
ready to go.

41:22.280 --> 41:23.820
The GM's Office, PR, and I

41:24.280 --> 41:25.090
are pulling an all-nighter

41:25.110 --> 41:25.980
to back you up.

41:28.000 --> 41:28.490
Everyone,

41:29.400 --> 41:30.380
time to grind.

41:31.280 --> 41:31.650
Let's go!

41:32.190 --> 41:32.740
- Let's do this! - Let's do this!

41:41.590 --> 41:42.010
Xu Chi.

41:46.920 --> 41:47.340
Mr. Kai.

41:47.760 --> 41:48.460
You're something else.

41:49.110 --> 41:50.210
I only agreed

41:50.400 --> 41:51.380
to sideline Richard.

41:51.480 --> 41:52.130
I didn't agree

41:52.190 --> 41:53.820
to let Hezong and All Buy share the blame!

41:54.800 --> 41:55.900
A public apology?

41:56.400 --> 41:57.610
I'd rather have him

41:57.880 --> 41:59.420
apologize to Mr. Liu in private!

42:02.800 --> 42:03.460
A general in the field

42:03.670 --> 42:04.900
can ignore the king's orders.

42:05.670 --> 42:06.130
The plan

42:06.190 --> 42:07.170
is already in motion.

42:07.230 --> 42:08.010
There's no turning back.

42:08.920 --> 42:09.340
Why?

42:09.920 --> 42:10.380
Why not...?

42:10.400 --> 42:11.570
Please take a closer look

42:11.590 --> 42:12.260
at my plan.

42:12.320 --> 42:13.300
I'm not apologizing.

42:13.880 --> 42:14.740
I'm taking responsibility.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.380
I firmly believe this plan

42:17.400 --> 42:18.050
is the best way

42:18.110 --> 42:19.260
to resolve this crisis.

42:19.550 --> 42:20.570
It keeps Hezong

42:20.630 --> 42:21.820
and All Buy working together,

42:22.510 --> 42:23.380
and it actually helps

42:23.440 --> 42:24.380
people like Mr. Liu

42:24.710 --> 42:25.530
who got hurt

42:25.590 --> 42:26.570
in this whole thing.

42:27.070 --> 42:28.170
What if something goes wrong?

42:32.800 --> 42:33.340
I'll resign.

42:45.110 --> 42:45.780
My college classmate

42:45.840 --> 42:47.260
does new media promotion and outreach.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.860
He just called to tell me

42:49.110 --> 42:50.130
two of All Buy's biggest competitors,

42:50.190 --> 42:51.690
Goushijie and TTBUY,

42:51.880 --> 42:52.780
are pushing negative publicity

42:52.840 --> 42:53.900
around 4 PM tomorrow.

42:55.000 --> 42:55.570
I got it.

42:57.030 --> 42:58.170
I already have a plan in place.

42:58.230 --> 42:59.530
We'll push ours out

42:59.590 --> 43:00.260
before noon tomorrow.

43:02.110 --> 43:02.610
Good.

43:03.590 --> 43:04.130
Lin.

43:05.800 --> 43:06.530
Thank you, really.

43:07.190 --> 43:07.740
Go do your thing.

43:07.800 --> 43:08.300
I'm hanging up.

43:16.840 --> 43:17.420
Xu Chi,

43:18.030 --> 43:19.340
there's no room for hesitation anymore.

43:42.620 --> 43:47.500
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

43:47.780 --> 43:52.660
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

43:52.900 --> 44:01.220
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

44:03.540 --> 44:08.460
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

44:08.620 --> 44:13.540
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

44:13.580 --> 44:18.140
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

44:18.380 --> 44:23.260
♪Why did you stop again?♪

44:23.860 --> 44:28.500
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

44:29.220 --> 44:33.580
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

44:33.620 --> 44:38.620
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

44:38.940 --> 44:43.820
♪Together with me♪

44:44.580 --> 44:49.460
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

44:49.980 --> 44:54.540
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

44:54.580 --> 44:59.140
♪You steal glances at me. You like me, right?♪

44:59.420 --> 45:04.300
♪Stop running away♪

45:25.420 --> 45:30.580
♪The sky slowly brightens, falling into our eyes♪

45:30.740 --> 45:35.580
♪The wind gradually stops, and finally it clears up♪

45:35.860 --> 45:40.900
♪The evening breeze brushes past your shoulder, and you turn your head♪

45:41.780 --> 45:46.900
♪You're irreplaceable♪

45:46.900 --> 45:47.900
MkvDrama.net
